<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 375 ALL OUT V SRI LANKA (332).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 375 ALL OUT V SRI LANKA (332).</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 375 in reply to Sri Lanka's first innings of 332 shortly after tea on the third day of the second and final test on Monday.</p>
</text>
